  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx/zipball/model-files-v1.1",
  "body": "Both Kokoro models in three precisions, exported with `scripts/export.py`.\n\n| file | size | notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| kokoro-v1.0.onnx | 326 MB | English, full precision |\n| kokoro-v1.0.fp16.onnx | 164 MB | spectral correlation 0.999 against fp32 |\n| kokoro-v1.0.int8.onnx | 114 MB | spectral correlation 0.916 against fp32 |\n| kokoro-v1.1-zh.onnx | 326 MB | Chinese and English, full precision |\n| kokoro-v1.1-zh.fp16.onnx | 164 MB | spectral correlation 0.994 against fp32 |\n| kokoro-v1.1-zh.int8.onnx | 114 MB | spectral correlation 0.874 against fp32 |\n| voices-v1.0.bin | 28 MB | 54 voices for the v1.0 models |\n| voices-v1.1-zh.bin | 53 MB | 103 voices for the v1.1-zh models |\n\nEvery model in this release carries three improvements over the previous exports:\n\n- a **duration output**, which kokoro-onnx 0.6.0 uses for `create_timed()` timestamps and for `create(continuous=True)` sliding window synthesis\n- a **float `speed` input**. The previously published kokoro-v1.1-zh.onnx declared it as int32, so fractional speeds were truncated and `speed=0.9` crashed the model (#155)\n- **config.json embedded in the graph metadata**, so the vocabulary travels with the model and no `vocab_config` argument is needed\n\nAll variants keep float inputs and outputs and are called identically.\n\nNote: kokoro-v1.1-zh.onnx replaces the file published in this release on Mar 1 2025. Same weights, fixed graph contract.",
